Hai! Aku siapkan Landing Page modern dan interaktif untuk **Kodein** dengan tema gelap (*slate & neon cyan/amber*), *hero banner* persuasif, playground simulasi kode langsung (*prompt-to-preview*), komparasi fitur, dan tabel harga lengkap dengan switch bulanan/tahunan berdiskon.

Berikut pembaruan berkasnya agar langsung tampil di Live Preview:

```file:style.css
/* Kodein Design System & Glow Utilities */
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --neon-cyan: #06b6d4;
  --neon-amber: #f59e0b;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
  background-color: #030712;
  color: #f1f5f9;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

code, pre, .font-mono {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
}

/* Background Gradients & Glows */
.bg-radial-gradient {
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) 0%, rgba(3, 7, 18, 0) 70%);
}

.glow-cyan {
  box-shadow: 0 0 50px -10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
}

.glow-amber {
  box-shadow: 0 0 45px -10px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
}

/* Custom Scrollbar */
::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 7px;
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: #030712;
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: #1f2937;
  border-radius: 9999px;
}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
  background: #374151;
}

/* Smooth Accordion */
.faq-answer {
  transition: max-height 0.3s cubic-bezier(0, 1, 0, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
}

/* Badge Pulse */
@keyframes subtlePulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scale(1); }
  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }
}
.badge-pulse {
  animation: subtlePulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
